Once you have downloaded the final versions of all files, initialize the database one last time.
Set yourself as admin again.
Then you can remove the "home" page that has the initialize database button.
This page is not needed for the video demonstration, and no further .sql edits will be made.

First step: 
Go into app.py
Find these lines:

@app.route("/")
def index():
    return render_template("index.html")

And replace it with this:

@app.route("/")
def index():
    if "user_id" in session:
        return redirect(url_for("dashboard"))
    return redirect(url_for("login"))

Second step:
Go to the base.html file
Find this line and delete it

<a href="{{ url_for('index') }}">Home</a>
